A trailing comment takes a tab, a run start and its whole separator

```
a	%% hidden
.
<p>a	%% hidden</p>
```

```
a  %% hidden
.
<p>a</p>
```

```
:: a	%% hidden
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt>a	%% hidden</dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: %% hidden
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt></dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
</dl>
```

```
| a	%% hidden | b |
|---|---|
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">a	%% hidden</th><th scope="col">b</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| %% hidden | b |
|---|---|
| 1 | 2 |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col"></th><th scope="col">b</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
![alt](u)
^ cap	%% hidden
.
<figure>
  <img src="u" alt="alt">
  <figcaption>cap	%% hidden</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![alt](u)
^ %% hidden
.
<p><img src="u" alt="alt">
^</p>
```

```
::: note [a	%% hidden]
body
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p class="div-label">a	%% hidden</p>
  <p>body</p>
</aside>
```

```
::: note [%% hidden]
body
:::
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p class="div-label"></p>
  <p>body</p>
</aside>
```

```
a%%b and 50%% stay
.
<p>a%%b and 50%% stay</p>
```

```
[a	%% hidden](/u)
.
<p><a href="/u">a	%% hidden</a></p>
```

```
[%% hidden](/u)
.
<p><a href="/u"></a></p>
```
